<title>FRANCE: France's Chirac to give TV interview on March 10.</title>
<headline>France's Chirac to give TV interview on March 10.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>French President Jacques Chirac will give a televised interview on March 10, presidential aides said on Monday.</p>
<p>They said Chirac was expected to speak about youth unemployment, among other issues.</p>
<p>He will be interviewed by two journalists on France 2 television, the aides said.</p>
